</section>

<section id="method" class="tab-panel">
  <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:6px">Methodology & Transparency</h2>
  <p class="text-muted" style="font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:20px">Every formula, every factor, every limitation — documented.</p>
  <div class="alert alert-warn">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M1 21h22L12 2 1 21zm12-3h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2v-4h2v4z"/></svg>
    <div><strong>Scientific integrity.</strong> Factors are demo values, not universal constants. Real values vary up to 17× by region.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card-title">Emission Formula</div>
    <pre>estimated_emissions = activity_value × emission_factor
total = Σ(activity × factor) across all categories</pre></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card-title">Factors (Demo Values)</div>
    <table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th class="num">Factor</th><th>Unit</th><th>Confidence</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Electricity</td><td class="num">0.45</td><td>kg CO₂e/kWh</td><td><span class="rec-badge medium">Low</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Water</td><td class="num">0.0003</td><td>kg CO₂e/L</td><td><span class="rec-badge medium">Low</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Waste (landfill)</td><td class="num">0.5</td><td>kg CO₂e/kg</td><td><span class="rec-badge medium">Low</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Transport</td><td class="num">0.192</td><td>kg CO₂e/km</td><td><span class="rec-badge medium">Low</span></td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card-title">GAIA Agent</div>
    <p style="font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:12px">GAIA is a <strong>fully local</strong> AI agent. It uses two components:</p>
    <ol style="padding-left:20px;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.8">
      <li><strong>Neural intent classifier</strong> — embeddings via hashing + cosine similarity to detect what you're asking</li>
      <li><strong>MLP predictor</strong> — tiny 4→8→1 neural network trained via backprop on your assessment history to forecast next month</li>
    </ol>
    <p style="font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px"><strong>No external API.</strong> No cloud. No GPT. Everything computes in your browser.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card"><div class="card-title">Limitations</div>
    <ul style="padding-left:20px;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.9">
      <li>Factors are global averages — real regional values vary 10×+</li>
      <li>Water emissions only capture treatment + pumping</li>
      <li>GAIA predictions are statistical — not scientific forecasts</li>
      <li>Estimates ≠ verified measurements</li>
      <li>Data stored in localStorage — clearing browser erases it</li>
    </ul></div>
</section>

</main>

